== 1. the frame
canvas 64 x 64 (study 1, env_frame.CANVAS); grid placed at row offset 1, column 0; the frozen agent code reads rows 1 to 62 only (study 1, g_motion.py:30-31); so the largest grid it can present at one cell per level cell is 62 rows x 64 columns
rule: a game is eligible only if every one of its levels 0 to 4 has at most 62 rows and at most 64 columns

